# Milestone: M6 wave 1
# Origin: legacy tests/2.x/atom-clone.chk
# Covers: atom-method dispatch + atom-clone perf contract.
#
# `1.clone()` resolves through the realm-global Integer atom proto and
# short-circuits to return the receiver value directly per
# S-atom-clone-perf.  Subsequent arithmetic on the cloned atom remains
# valid (cloned int is still an int).
#
# Wave-1 limited port: the legacy fixture's third line `a.protos`
# expected `[1]` — a List literal printing.  v1.0 prints the synthetic
# proto-list UObject as `<?>` (UVAL_OBJECT formatter).  The List literal
# print form defers to Wave 2.

var a = 1.clone()
[00000000] 1

a + 2
[00000001] 3
